# Source: Added the "Emote overrides" tab to the configuration window.\nPick a locked emote, then pick the emotes it is allowed to land on. Emote Swap will then use your list instead of finding a best match, in the order you put it in.\nIf none of them can be played, the plugin tells you which ones it skipped and why.
changelog.2.2.0.0.99ae3ed3 = 
# Source: Added "Support me on Ko-fi" and "Discord" buttons to the main window.
changelog.2.2.0.0.ac6010ab = 
# Source: The "Fav" and "Blocked" tabs of the main window now have their own dropdown, to add an emote to either list without hunting for it in the other tabs.
changelog.2.2.0.0.d4ad1225 = 
# Source: Technical Changes
changelog.2.2.0.0.d80295d6 = 
# Source: Fixed "Create a mod" sometimes writing the wrong animation instead of the one you asked for.
changelog.2.2.0.0.f2789edb = 
# Source: Various technical enhancements.
changelog.2.2.0.0.fe26324e = 
# Source: Animation refresh rework
changelog.2.3.0.0.07d79f01 = 
# Source: Reworked how the plugin refreshes an animation, it is now way more efficient and optimized. Dropped from 10+ sigs to 2.
changelog.2.3.0.0.105ef1de = 
# Source: Added "Add an override..." to the right click menu of the main UI.\nIt opens the "Emote overrides" tab with the emote already picked.
