# Source: Technical Changes
changelog.2.4.0.1.d80295d6 = 
# Source: Added a brand new interface, which is now the default one.\nEvery window has been redesigned: the main UI, the settings, "Create a mod", the hotbar assignment, the changelog and the logs.\nIf you prefer the old look, you can switch back to the classic interface at any time in the settings.
changelog.2.4.0.1.da488787 = 
# Source: Changing the language, the text size or the interface is now instant.
changelog.2.4.0.1.dc02f174 = 
# Source: The new interface has its own window settings, click the Window Options button next to the close button. It allows you to adjust opacity, text size, make the plugin always on top, click through, lock its position, its width and/or height, and make the windows stay visible in gpose, when the UI is hidden, during cutscenes, or when the game hides its own UI.
changelog.2.4.0.1.e862aedf = 
# Source: Added a preview popup next to the main UI. Click an emote to make it appear. In Emote Swap mode, it will show you which of your emotes it will play through, offer you to play it, add it to your favorites, block it, assign it to a hotbar or play it on your minion, pet or chocobo.\nDouble click an emote to play it right away. You can turn the popup off in the settings.
